stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> INITIATED : payment created

    INITIATED --> FUNDS_HELD : checks pass and funds available
    INITIATED --> REJECTED : check fails or insufficient funds

    FUNDS_HELD --> SENT_TO_BILLER : request sent to biller

    SENT_TO_BILLER --> COMPLETED : biller confirms
    SENT_TO_BILLER --> FAILED : biller refuses
    SENT_TO_BILLER --> UNKNOWN : no answer in 10 s

    UNKNOWN --> COMPLETED : late confirmation
    UNKNOWN --> FAILED : late refusal or reconciliation finds nothing

    FAILED --> REFUNDED : hold released to wallet

    COMPLETED --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]
    REFUNDED --> [*]

    note right of UNKNOWN
        Money stays held.
        Never refunded automatically.
    end note
